<h2>Unknown account filter</h2>
<p>The account list is filter-driven and the filter is a strict whitelist, so a missing or mistyped one is refused
  rather than silently answered with a different list.</p>
<p class="footnote"><%= @reason %></p>
<ul>
  <% RodauthAdmin::AccountList::FILTERS.each do |filter| %>
    <li><a href="/accounts?filter=<%= filter %>"><code><%= filter %></code></a></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
